# CODEOWNERS — auto-request review from owners when matching files change.
# Docs: https://docs.gitlab.com/user/project/codeowners/
# Format: <path glob>  @user  @group  email@example.com
# Later matches win. On CE, code-owner *approval enforcement* is EE — but the
# auto-assignment of owners as reviewers works on Free.

# Default owner for everything
*                       @homelab-admin

# Per-area examples (edit to taste)
# /docs/                @homelab-admin
# *.tf                  @homelab/infra
# /.gitlab-ci.yml       @homelab/platform
# /db/migrations/       @homelab/backend
